items.problem:
The baseline measures only a day-1 learner with a fresh HTTP cache. Several problems therefore do not show in it:
- the CPU cost for real returning learners (Today 420 → 1066 ms at 4x);
- the 1.3-16 s network-first return-visit penalty;
- the full 884 KB download on every release;
- the all-lessons download of drills and level checks (cold checkpoint/A1 7320 ms, measured in review with an ad-hoc selector).
The visibility polling also forces 25-44 ms of layout per transition.

