  - first-session passage open ≤ 400 ms on the phone;
  - offline, no listed row fails to open. Unreachable rows must be marked 'not on this device', as today (e2e offline case).

items.problem:
Route content starts only after the view's import chain evaluates:
- a1-01.json at 2842 ms;
- slang.json at 2949 ms;
- scenario at 2658 ms.
Today's next-lesson file waits for today.js. A level check's and a drill's content waits for checkpoint.js and drill.js.

items.fix:
router.js gets a DATA map keyed by route pattern, for example:
- lesson/:id → content.lesson(id) and taxonomy;
- scenario/:id → content.scenario?.(id) ?? content.scenarios();
- expressions → slang;
- reading → content.center?.('read');
- real-life → scenarioIndex;
- checkpoint/:level → content.pool?.(level);
- drill → content.pool?.(l) for the learner's levels up to course level + 1.
Each entry is called with .catch(() => {}) just before match.load(). For today, also content.lesson(model().next?.id). The methods are feature-detected per contract C-1.

