items.fix:
On install:
- read the previous release's release.json from the old cache;
- copy every file whose hash is unchanged, fetch only the changed ones, and verify the hash of each fetched file;
- on a mismatch, refetch once with a cache-busting query (?r=<hash>) and store it under the plain URL; if it still mismatches, fail the install so the old release stays active;
- move content/lessons/* entries whose hash is unchanged into the new cache before activate deletes the old caches. Changed saved lessons are refetched, best effort.

